> @carlos-zamora why the heck doesn't this work? It works to change the value of the setting, but it does _not_ work on the initial load of the Launch page. It always selects UseNew. But if I change the value, DONT SAVE, navigate away from the page, then back to the page, then it loads correctly. What gives?

@zadjii-msft you need to update "GlobalAppSettings::Copy()". When SUI is created, we clone the settings model using `Copy`. So your value isn't getting passed over, resulting in the default value being used. After that, SUI should work just fine.

Surprised to hear about the "navigate away" thing. I couldn't get a repro on that, this should fix your issue entirely.
